id=flipunlock_prop
name=FlipUnlock Companion (prop + touch + display)
version=10
versionCode=10
author=flip
description=companion for the LSPosed module: multi_display_type=1; flip2 touch patch (capfold->ENODEV, fixes inner-panel-removed hard reset; OS4.0.3/4.0.4 share one stock, delegated to flip_outer_force when installed); boot-time CLOSED switch for single-outer-screen; phantom second display disabled via display layout table (fixes control-centre/big-folder flicker); lock-screen torch/camera buttons hidden; optional experimental layer_has_aod write (persist.flipunlock.aod.panel_flag, default off); flip1 CWB guard
